    {
      "name": "Vulnerable to Dispelling",
      "actions": null,
      "traits": [],
      "description": "<p>The animated dragonstorm can be targeted by disjunction and dispel magic. If targeted by such a spell of 9th rank or higher, the construct loses its resistance to acid, cold, electricity, fire, and physical damage and is slowed 1 for <span class=\"roll\" onclick=\"roll(this)\">1d4</span> rounds.</p>",
